      "message": "Benchmark results:\n\n```\nBenchmarks for read-only caches during online reindexing (n\u003d3, open source gerrit repo (50254 changes)):\n \nempty cache, read-write: 89.5 +- 3.2 s\nempty cache, read-only: 67.0 +- 1.1 s\nfull cache, read-write: 38.4 +- 2.5 s\nfull cache, read-only: 37.3 +- 0.5\n \nConclusions:\nusing read-only caches saved about 25% of the time, if caches were not being used, i.e. empty\nCaches are being used when available looking at the times, i.e. reading works as intended\n```",
